// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3230914365" "My dad and I were both kidnapped from the store. I got away because the Clockwork helped me, but the Lost, they still have my dad. I'm so worried about him, it hurts. I tried looking on my own, but if it weren't for the Clockwork the Lost would have caught me. So I've been asking for help. I just got a call from Doctor Delilah Stein and she was trying to tell me that she may have found something, but her call got cut off, and I know she's in trouble. Could you help her, {HeroName}?"
// AcceptString :
"P244948412" "Help Doc Delilah"
// SendOffString :
"P3672105486" "You are so awesome! Doc Delilah used to be a Hero, too, but she's, like, an archeologist now. She's digging all around here looking for stuff so she's been everywhere and has talked to a lot of people. I asked her to keep an eye out for anything about my dad, just in case. So, of course, she gets cornered by some Vahzilok somewhere without cell reception. She's okay right now, but those Vahzilok guys are really scary. You better get her out of there."
// TaskTitle :
"P1672633814" "<color deepskyblue>I Lost My Daddy</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

