"P1649386250" "Now that we know where Dad is, the only thing left is to get him. <color orange>This may be kinda rough, though. You will be careful, right? Or get, like, a super-team or something?</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3672659470" "Rescue Mr. Yin"
// SendOffString :
"P2167119757" "I think it's going to be pretty tough in there. Just, like, be careful, okay? I wouldn't want to be all sad because I got Dad back, but you got killed and stuff. <br>Oh, hey! That's an idea! Give me a second... <br><br>Okay, I asked the Clockwork King really nicely and he's agreed to let you borrow some of the soldiers he has protecting me. It's a really big step for him. I mean, he's kinda paranoid, sure, but deep down I think he's an okay guy."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2066776003" "I know it's tough, but I also know you can do it. I know what you're really like and I believe in you."
